{"id":11613,"artist":"Traditional Christmas Song","title":"O Come, All Ye Faithful","lyrics_plain":"O come, all ye faithful,\nJoyful and triumphant,\nO come ye, O come ye to Bethlehem.\nCome and behold Him,\nBorn the King of Angels!\nO come, let us adore Him,\nO come, let us adore Him,\nO come, let us adore Him,\nChrist the Lord.\nSing, alleluia,\nAll ye choirs of angels;\nO sing, all ye blissful ones\nof heaven above.\nGlory to God\nIn the highest glory!\nO come, let us adore Him,\nO come, let us adore Him,\nO come, let us adore Him,\nChrist the Lord.\nYea, Lord, we greet Thee,\nBorn this happy morning;\nJesus, to Thee be the glory given;\nWord of the Father,\nNow in the flesh appearing,\nO come, let us adore Him,\nO come, let us adore Him,\nO come, let us adore Him,\nChrist the Lord.","lyrics_synced":"[00:03.75] O come, all ye faithful,\n[00:08.57] Joyful and triumphant,\n[00:12.86] O come ye, O come ye to Bethlehem.\n[00:21.44] Come and behold Him,\n[00:25.71] Born the King of Angels!\n[00:29.46] O come, let us adore Him,\n[00:33.75] O come, let us adore Him,\n[00:38.04] O come, let us adore Him,\n[00:42.86] Christ the Lord.\n[00:47.14] Sing, alleluia,\n[00:51.43] All ye choirs of angels;\n[00:55.71] O sing, all ye blissful ones\n[00:59.46] of heaven above.\n[01:04.30] Glory to God\n[01:08.57] In the highest glory!\n[01:12.32] O come, let us adore Him,\n[01:16.61] O come, let us adore Him,\n[01:20.89] O come, let us adore Him,\n[01:25.71] Christ the Lord.\n[01:30.00] Yea, Lord, we greet Thee,\n[01:34.29] Born this happy morning;\n[01:38.57] Jesus, to Thee be the glory given;\n[01:47.16] Word of the Father,\n[01:51.43] Now in the flesh appearing,\n[01:55.18] O come, let us adore Him,\n[01:59.46] O come, let us adore Him,\n[02:03.96] O come, let us adore Him,\n[02:10.74] Christ the Lord.","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:03.74] <00:03.74>O <00:04.28>come, <00:05.35>all <00:05.89>ye <00:06.42>faith <00:07.49>ful,\n[00:08.57] <00:08.57>Jo <00:09.10>y <00:09.64>ful <00:1